<title>UK: Panamanian ship holed, leaks grain in Mississippi.</title>
<headline>Panamanian ship holed, leaks grain in Mississippi.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Panamanian bulk carrier Flag Diamond was struck by a river tug on Wednesday while offloading grain at mile 120 in the Mississippi river, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service reported.</p>
<p>The 115,200 dwt Flag Diamond sustained a two metre square gash in its starboard side and grain is currently leaking into the water.</p>
</text>
